2. Optical Glass Catalog (crates/optics-glass/data/optical_glasses.json)
   Physical dispersion coefficients (Sellmeier, Cauchy, and polynomial constants)
   for 646 optical materials from optical glass manufacturers (Schott AG, Ohara Corp,
   CDGM Glass Co., Hoya Corp, Hikari, Sumita Optical Glass, and public domain infrared
   crystals).
   Physical refractive indices and dispersion constants represent factual physical
   properties of materials and are published openly by manufacturers for engineering
   and academic simulation.

